## 1. thunderboot.its — FIT 镜像定义

**路径:** `/home/b4qaq/project/RK3506G2/rk3506_linux6.1_sdk_v1.2.0_iot_evm/device/rockchip/.chips/rk3506/thunderboot.its`

```dts
/*
 * Copyright (C) 2024 Rockchip Electronics Co., Ltd
 *
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
 */

/dts-v1/;
/ {
    description = "U-Boot FIT source file for arm";

    images {
        fdt {
            data = /incbin/("@KERNEL_DTB@");
            type = "flat_dt";
            arch = "arm";
            compression = "none";
            load = <0x00063000>;

            hash {
                algo = "sha256";
            };
        };

        kernel {
            data = /incbin/("@KERNEL_IMG@");
            type = "kernel";
            arch = "arm";
            os = "linux";
            compression = "none";
            entry = <0x01100000>;
            load = <0x01100000>;

            hash {
                algo = "sha256";
            };
        };
    };

    configurations {
        default = "conf";

        conf {
            description = "Boot Linux kernel with FDT blob and no ramdisk";
            rollback-index = <0x00>;
            fdt = "fdt";
            kernel = "kernel";

            signature {
                algo = "sha256,rsa2048";
                padding = "pss";
                key-name-hint = "dev";
                sign-images = "fdt", "kernel", "multi";
            };
        };
    };
};
```

**要点:**
- 定义了两个镜像节点：**fdt** (设备树) 和 **kernel** (内核)
- FDT 加载地址 `0x00063000`，kernel 入口和加载地址均为 `0x01100000`
- 使用 `sha256` 哈希校验，支持 `sha256,rsa2048` + PSS 签名（安全启动）
- `@KERNEL_DTB@` 和 `@KERNEL_IMG@` 为占位符，由 `mk-fitimage.sh` 替换

